WEBVTT

00:00:58.550 --> 00:01:00.440
♫ Shady Grove, my little love ♫


00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.700
♫ Shady Grove, my darlin' ♫

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.580
♫ Shady Grove, my little love ♫

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:09.270
♫ Going back to Harlan ♫

00:01:09.270 --> 00:01:13.140
Era un son tan fermoso,

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.560
a voz de Doc Watson

00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:18.160
e a cadencia ondulante do banjo.

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:22.800
E despois de estar totalmente obsesionada

00:01:22.800 --> 00:01:25.970
coa colosal historia e riqueza

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:27.340
da cultura chinesa,

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:30.120
era un completo acougo